      "owner": true,
      "description": "On the owner's Mac a window opens, the dot moves with WASD or the arrows, and Esc quits. The owner plays it and accepts it. CI does not compute this feature; until patch X4 teaches `cargo xtask acceptance` owner-checked features, it reports no checks.",
